{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Image Domain Sharding Under HTTP2.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Image Domain Sharding Under HTTP2.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"image domain sharding under http2 image domain sharding under http2","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Image Domain Sharding Under HTTP2.md","fileName":"Image Domain Sharding Under HTTP2.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Image Domain Sharding Under HTTP2","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-28 04:01\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Adaptive Image Delivery and Caching]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Adaptive Image Delivery and Caching","Browser Connection Pool Competition","highperformanceimages.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Image Domain Sharding Under HTTP2.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Image Domain Sharding Under HTTP2.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"image domain sharding under http2 image domain sharding under http2","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Image Domain Sharding Under HTTP2.md","fileName":"Image Domain Sharding Under HTTP2.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Image Domain Sharding Under HTTP2","heading":"Image Domain Sharding Under HTTP2","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Domain sharding spreads image requests across hostnames to bypass per-origin connection limits in older HTTP behavior. Each shard also adds DNS, connection, TLS, and operational overhead.\n\nWith HTTP/2 multiplexing, unnecessary shards divide requests across separate connections and prevent one prioritization system from coordinating them. A delivery design should therefore evaluate sharding against the actual protocol path instead of preserving a workaround after its original constraint has changed. See [[Browser Connection Pool Competition]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Adaptive Image Delivery and Caching","Browser Connection Pool Competition","highperformanceimages.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Image Domain Sharding Under HTTP2.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Image Domain Sharding Under HTTP2.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"image domain sharding under http2 image domain sharding under http2","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Image Domain Sharding Under HTTP2.md","fileName":"Image Domain Sharding Under HTTP2.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Image Domain Sharding Under HTTP2","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[highperformanceimages.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Adaptive Image Delivery and Caching","Browser Connection Pool Competition","highperformanceimages.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}